  "body": "What is owed: PR #974 (merge commit c69e839a) shipped the MCP tool `set_operation_coolant`, but the camcraft-mcp skill (`.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/`) has no row for it in its tool table. Found by the review of PR #974 (non-blocking note).\n\nWhy: AGENTS.md \"Commands ship with an MCP tool\" - the agent surface keeps up with what shipped (P5).\n\nNotes: this is a process-file change, so the PR bumps `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` by one and is announced on the pinned issue #681 when it merges.\n\nDone means: the skill's tool table lists `set_operation_coolant` with its parameters and refusals as implemented in `crates/app/src/mcp/` (coolant tools), and `PROCESS_VERSION` is bumped.\n",
